OL,3,GNEWSAActivists found guilty of theft of
OL,4,AKing's lambs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree animal rights activists have been
OL,7,Ffound guilty of stealing three lambs
OL,8,Ffrom the King's Sandringham Estate.
OL,10,FThroughout a three-day trial, Rosa
OL,11,FSharkey, 26, Sarah Foy, 26, and Rose
OL,12,FPatterson, 37, insisted they rescued
OL,13,Fthe animals in 2023.
OL,15,FThe members of campaign group Animal
OL,16,FRising also said they believed the King
OL,17,F"would have consented to their rescue"
OL,18,Fdue to being an "environmentalist".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
