OL,3,GNEWSAActivists found guilty of theft of
OL,4,AKing's lambs
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a jury, made up of five men and
OL,7,Fseven women, unanimously found all
OL,8,Fthree defendants guilty of theft at
OL,9,FNorwich Crown Court. Sentencing is
OL,10,Fexpected to take place later on
OL,11,FThursday.
